 packaged app

The ASAR archive stays read-only and Electron resolves ASAR paths only for
execFile, not for the spawnSync the landlock probe uses, so the
sandbox-local provider found no usable backend inside the Flatpak bundle:

- unpack **/bin/landlock-run from the archive so the launcher exists on
  the filesystem at all.
- honor DSH_LANDLOCK_LAUNCHER ahead of the ASAR-path resolution, so a
  deployment that copies the launcher outside the archive can point the
  provider at it.

